{
  "name": "dsh-twin-memory",
  "version": "2.0.1",
  "description": "「没人可以拯救你，除了另一个自己。」双子记忆 v2 合体版：一个插件内置攻略 + 身份卡 + 时光机（vendored 快照/回退/消息级撤回/体检引擎，MIT 授权收编）。列表里只见双子，不见 undo —— 插件列表一行，功能一样不少。零常驻进程，跑起来的只有 AI 本身。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/sdfsd85fds74f9d8/dsh-twin-memory"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "twin-memory",
    "dual-instance",
    "双子记忆"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "manifestVersion": 1
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "skill/**/*",
    "templates/*",
    "scripts/*",
    "locale/*.json",
    "README.md",
    "icon.svg"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.4"
  }
}